  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Outsourcing of administrative tasks related to the receipt of visa applications on behalf of Brazil and the consulate general of Brazil inPort-au-Prince, Haiti</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">At the request of the Consulate General of Brazil in Port Au Prince, Haiti, IOM will establish and operate a Brazil Visa Application Centre (CAVB) on behalf of the Consulate General of Brazil&#x2019;s Visa Office in Port-au-Prince, exclusively dedicated to Haitian visa applicants seeking safe and legal migration to the Federative Republic Brazil.</narrative>
